<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"384\">De MSI Thin 15 is een krachtige gaming laptop die geschikt is voor gaming, school en dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de Intel Core i5-processor van de 12e generatie en de NVIDIA RTX 3050 videokaart kun je moderne games spelen en soepel multitasken. Het slanke ontwerp maakt deze laptop ook geschikt om mee te nemen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"412\"><strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"395\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"398\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"622\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"429\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"432\">⭐ Intel Core i5 12e generatie voor sterke prestaties<br data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"487\">⭐ NVIDIA RTX 3050 voor moderne gaming<br data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"527\">⭐ 16GB RAM voor soepel multitasken<br data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"564\">⭐ Snelle 512GB SSD-opslag<br data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"592\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⭐ Dun en licht gaming design</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"967\">📋 <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"644\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\"><strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"661\">Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (12e generatie)<br data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"694\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"702\">RAM:</strong> 16GB DDR4<br data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"726\">Opslag:</strong> 512GB SSD<br data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"739\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"759\">Grafische kaart:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (4GB VRAM)<br data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\"><strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"808\">Scherm:</strong> 15.6 inch Full HD, 144Hz<br data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\"><strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"858\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> Windows 11<br data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"872\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"891\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB, HDMI<br data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"921\"><strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"931\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"940\"><strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"950\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1220\">📋 <strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1002\">Gameprestaties (schatting)</strong><br data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1005\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1018\">Fortnite:</strong> ± 90–120 FPS (1080p, Medium/High settings)<br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\"><strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1076\">Warzone:</strong> ± 60–75 FPS (1080p, Medium settings)<br data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1116\"><strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1126\">GTA V:</strong> ± 90 FPS (1080p, High settings)<br data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1161\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1175\">Minecraft:</strong> ± 200+ FPS (1080p, standaard instellingen)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1279\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1240\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1243\">MSI Thin 15 B12UC-2013NL<br data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\">Oplader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1340\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1303\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1306\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
